  "description": "Header-free text serialization for Copse trees, in both grammars: preorder (\"a(b(d,e),c)\") and level-order (\"a;b,c;d,e\"). Deserialize a string into a full tree or stream a file/reader into a forward-only one (both deferred; sync and async); serialize any tree back to text. The one Copse package that spans both the sync and async families.",
